WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
Allah gave Alyasa a light and chose him as a prophet, to keep guiding the people.

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:10.168
Ilyas had grown old. He passed the mission of guiding the people to the young Alyasa.

3
00:00:10.568 --> 00:00:17.408
Alyasa walked into the marketplace and called out, Put down your idols! Only the One Allah deserves our worship!

4
00:00:17.808 --> 00:00:23.280
Some people listened. They gently set down the little stone statues in their homes and turned away.

5
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:30.232
Others laughed at him. But Alyasa did not get angry. He just smiled patiently and kept on guiding.

6
00:00:30.632 --> 00:00:36.272
Many years passed. The villagers worshipped Allah, helped one another, and the children played happily.

7
00:00:36.672 --> 00:00:42.984
Children, remember: Allah loves most those who guide others with patience and keep doing good!
